# How to run program
To run Program:
python run_bot.py YOURTICKER

Skip filters confirmation:
python run_bot.py YOURTICKER --skip-filters

Skip the filter & momentum confirmation:
python run_bot.py YOURTICKER --skip-filters --skip-entry-signal




